multitensor_system (iterable of dims)  -->  Initializer methods
       |                                        |
       | make_multitensor(default=...)          V
       +---------------------------------> initialize_multilinear(...)  -> many (weight,bias) pairs
                                           initialize_multizeros(...)   -> many zero tensors
                                           initialize_multiresidual(...) -> pairs-of-linear
                                           initialize_multiposterior(...) -> means + zeros
                                           initialize_multidirection_share(...) -> 8x8 directional maps
                                           symmetrize_*(...)  -> tie/copy tensors across dims
                                           weights_list <- collects all tensors (flat)


